  "description": "Modbus RTU/ASCII serial protocol library for .NET. Supports binary RTU (CRC-16), ASCII (LRC), and lightweight RtuSimple variants over SerialPort on Windows and Linux. Built on NewLife.IoT standard interfaces with APM tracing support and built-in runtime messages in 31 languages.  |  Modbus RTU/ASCII 串口协议库，支持二进制 RTU（CRC-16）、ASCII（LRC）与轻量 RtuSimple 变体，适配 Windows 与 Linux 串口，基于 NewLife.IoT 标准接口，内置 APM 链路追踪与 31 种语言运行时消息。",
  "iconFile": "leaf.png",
